OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FRain across Hebrides and around
OL,6,Fwest coast initially, with some patchy
OL,7,Foutbreaks elsewhere for the morning.
OL,8,FMore persistent rain extending to all
OL,9,Fduring afternoon, with some heavier
OL,10,Foutbreaks late afternoon. Brisk
OL,11,Fsoutherly winds touching gale in
OL,12,FHebrides.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FRain at first, most
OL,15,Fpersistent in west from early to mid-
OL,16,Fevening, clearing towards midnight as
OL,17,Fclear spells and scattered showers
OL,18,Fspread from west. Showers continuing
OL,19,Fovernight, with Inverness best
OL,20,Fsheltered.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
